[M31_PA_WS_RebelYell X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Rebel Yell"
LocLongDescription="Grant +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_AimBonus_Alt> aim, +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_WillBonus_Alt> will and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_MobilityBonus_Alt> mobility to allied vipers and yourself. Most other biological and cybernetic allies will gain +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_AimBonus> aim, +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_WillBonus> will and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_MobilityBonus> mobility instead. Lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_Duration> turn(s). Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has an <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Grant +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_AimBonus_Alt> aim, +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_WillBonus_Alt> will and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_MobilityBonus_Alt> mobility to allied vipers and yourself. Most other biological and cybernetic allies will gain +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_AimBonus> aim, +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_WillBonus> will and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_MobilityBonus> mobility instead. Lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_Duration> turn(s). Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_Radius> tile radius.<br><Bullet> The bonus applies to biological as well as cybernetic allies, but not to fully robotic units like SPARKs.<br><Bullet> Applies to panicking allies: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bAppliesToPanicked>. Clears panic: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bClearsPanic>.<br><Bullet> Applies to mind controlled allies: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bAppliesToMindControlled>. Clears mind control: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bClearsMindControl>.<br><Bullet> Applies to stunned allies: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bAppliesToStunned>. Clears stun: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_RebelYell_bClearsStun>.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"Fuses burn and wheels will turn, the ones who lie will never learn...\"</font>"
LocFlyOverText="Rebel Yell"

[M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Northern Winds"
LocLongDescription="At the end of each turn, all enemies in a <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_Radius> tile radius receive <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_Damage> points of frost damage and a stack of bitterfrost."
LocHelpText="At the end of each turn, all enemies in a <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_Radius> tile radius receive <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_Damage> points of frost damage frost damage and a stack of bitterfrost."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals frost damage and ignores armor.<br><Bullet> Requires line of sight: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_bRequireVisibility>.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Northern Winds</font> work while burning: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_bAllowWhileBurning>.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Northern Winds</font> work while concealed: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_bAllowWhileConcealed>.<br><Bullet> If <font color='#0bff9b'>Northern Winds</font> affect any enemy while <Ability:ClassName> is concealed, their concealment will be broken.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Northern Winds</font> activate before the start of the alien turn. If the <Ability:ClassName>'s concealment is broken by this ability, the enemies activated will get a full turn.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"Reduces the electricity bill for the AC usage on the Avenger.\"</font>"

[M31_PA_WS_NorthernWinds_Trigger X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Northern Winds"
LocFlyOverText="Northern Winds"

[M31_PA_WS_MetabolicBoost X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Metabolic Boost"
LocLongDescription="Coil tightly, gaining +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_MetabolicBoost_DodgeBonus> dodge until start of the next turn. Restores <Ability:M31_PA_WS_MetabolicBoost_Heal> HP and removes environmental ailments and disorientation. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Coil tightly, gaining +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_MetabolicBoost_DodgeBonus> dodge until start of the next turn. Restores <Ability:M31_PA_WS_MetabolicBoost_Heal> HP and removes environmental ailments and disorientation."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Metabolic Boost</font> removes the same environmental effects a Medikit does.<br><Bullet> Dodge bonus applies even when the <Ability:ClassName> is out of cover."

[M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Thrill of the Hunt"
LocLongDescription="Start each turn with an additional movement-only action. Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_AimPerStack> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_CritPerStack> crit until the end of the mission for every enemy that dies in your line of sight. Stacks up to <Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_MaxStacks> times."
LocHelpText="Start each turn with an additional movement-only action. Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_AimPerStack> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_CritPerStack> crit until the end of the mission for every enemy that dies in your line of sight. Stacks up to <Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_MaxStacks> times."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The <Ability:ClassName> has to be able to see the enemy when it dies to recieve the bonus.<br><Bullet> The <Ability:ClassName> will not recieve the bonus if they are not able to act. This includes panicking, bleeding out, being stunned, dazed, or dead.<br><Bullet> Doesn't apply when robotic enemies die: <Ability:M31_PA_WS_ThrillOfTheHunt_bExcludeRobotic>.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"There will be blood! Shed!\"</font>"


[M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Maelstrom Bolt"
LocLongDescription="Special bolt. Has +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom_CritBonus> critical chance against unflankable targets and +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom_AimBonus> aim against large units. Aim and critical chance can <font color='#0bff9b'>overflow</font>. Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Special bolt with bonus critical chance against unflankable targets and bonus aim against large units."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Overflow</font>: all aim above <Ability:M31_AutoFont>100</font> contributes to critical chance, and all critical chance above <Ability:M31_AutoFont>100</font> contributes to base weapon damage (<Ability:M31_AutoFont>25</font> critical chance = <Ability:M31_AutoFont>25%</font> base attack damage). The damage bonus cannot exceed <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom_MaxDamageBonus>.<br><Bullet> When <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Ballista> is equipped, critical chance bonus is increased to +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom_CritBonus_Ballista>, and aim bonus is increased to +<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Maelstrom_AimBonus_Ballista>.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"Sir, those are protoss archons. If they get too close, our men won't stand a chance!\"</font>"
