[M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Stun X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Impaling Bolt"
LocLongDescription="Special bolt. Stuns non-large units for <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Stun_StunDuration> actions, reduces their mobility by <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Stun_MobilityPenalty> and applies bleeding to organic units (<Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Stun_BleedDamage> damage per turn) for <Ability:M31_PA_WS_Bolt_Stun_DebuffDuration> turn(s). Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Special bolt that stuns the target, reduces its mobility and applies bleeding to organic units."
